== Effects ==
* Isaac's tears gain a worm trinket effect that changes every 3 seconds of the in-game timer. The effects include:
** {{t|Pulse Worm}}
** {{t|Ring Worm}}
** {{t|Tape Worm|n}}
** {{t|Whip Worm}}
** {{t|Wiggle Worm}}
** {{t|Flat Worm}}
** {{t|Hook Worm}}
** {{t|Lazy Worm|n}}
** {{t|Ouroboros Worm|r}}
** {{t|Brain Worm}}
* The order of the effects is always as above, in a cycle.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc+|r+}} This trinket has a 1% chance to drop when defeating {{e|Pin}}, {{e|Larry Jr.}}, {{e|The Hollow}} or {{e|Scolex}}.{{dlc-}}
* Rainbow Worm can't give the effects of worms that are already in effect (with {{I|Mom's Purse}} or {{I|Belly Button}}) or ones that were [[Smelter|gulped]].
** Therefore, somehow gulping all the worm trinkets in one run makes Rainbow Worm useless.
** {{dlc|r}} Rainbow Worm acts as giving a second copy of worms you're currently holding, usually doubling any stat increases of the worm.

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Mom's Box|anr}}: Doubles the effect of each worm.
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r}} / {{t|Rainbow Worm|r}} : Having Rainbow Worm as a Golden Trinket doubles the effect of each worm if possible whereas having Mom's Box triples them.
** Having both quadruples the effect of each worm if possible.
* {{i|Tractor Beam}}: The altered patterns tears travel in is confined to the beam allowing Isaac to benefit from the stat bonuses granted without losing accuracy.

